      "round": 2,
      "type": "numeric",
      "prompt": "A two-state system in equilibrium satisfies \\(Ax + Bu = 0\\). If \\(A = \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\), \\(B = \\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}\\), and \\(u = 4\\), the first component \\(x_1\\) is",
      "explanation": "Solve \\(-x_1 + 4 = 0\\) for the first row: \\(x_1 = 4\\). The second row gives \\(-2x_2 + 8 = 0\\), so \\(x_2 = 4\\). The eigenvalues \\(-1, -2\\) are not the equilibrium.",
      "figure": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 130\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\"><title>diagonal A</title><text x=\"28\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">[</text><text x=\"168\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">]</text><text x=\"98\" y=\"58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">-1   0</text><text x=\"98\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">0   -2</text></svg>",
      "figure_alt": "A 2 by 2 diagonal matrix.",
